Removed 2026-10-17: Musashi's MAME-derived m68kfpu.c and m68kmmu.h (MAME-team copyright, MAME licence). They are
replaced by crates/retro-m68k/vendor/m68k_nofpu.h (ours, MIT): the engines run a 68020 with no FPU and no PMMU, which
traps those opcodes (F-line) exactly as the stubs do. m68kcpu.c is MODIFIED by us at its include of those two files.

